# Docker build context is the repo root for the dashboard image (it needs shared/). Keep it lean:
# without these the context includes every node_modules tree and a 45 MB APK.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
.git
mobile/android
mobile/www/shared
agents/host-remote-desktop/*.exe
*.apk
*.gz
core/data
insights/collector/data
connectors/manager/data
